Parts of it follow other projects closely:

- SPAKE2 for pairing (lib/src/crypto/spake2.dart) reproduces BoringSSL's
  SPAKE2 over edwards25519 byte for byte, including its fixed points M and N.
  BoringSSL: https://boringssl.googlesource.com/boringssl (ISC and OpenSSL
  licenses).

- The incremental install protocol (lib/src/services/incremental.dart) follows
  the Android Open Source Project's adb client
  (packages/modules/adb/client/incremental*.cpp): request and block layouts,
  the verity tree arithmetic, and the order of an APK's priority blocks.
